error[E0017]: 'buf' does not live long enough to be returned

   ┌─ test/fail/02_return_scratch.nul:14:5
   │
 9 │     var scratch = arena.child()
   │         ───────  'scratch' is created here, as a child of 'arena'
   ·
11 │     var buf = scratch.create(Buffer)
   │         ───  'buf' lives in 'scratch'
   ·
14 │     return buf
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^  returned here, but 'scratch' dies first
   │
   = note: a result is stored into the caller, so it has to live in an arena the caller
           already has. 'scratch' is made in this function, and dies with it.
   │
   = help: 'buf' has to outlive this function. One way, allocating it from 'arena':
   │
11 │ -     var buf = scratch.create(Buffer)
11 │ +     var buf = arena.create(Buffer)
   │
